          <h4>How to get things</h4>
          <p>Gifts, statics, NPC trades, raid dens with their star tiers and unlock conditions, Game Corner
          prizes, daily swarms and legendary requirements, from the same field guide's
          <code>acquisition-data.json</code> — itself transcribed from the 2.1.1.1 raid and acquisition
          spreadsheets, which it checksums. ${Object.keys(ACQ).length} species have a documented way in.
          Everything else is reached by evolution, and the app walks the line back for you rather than
          leaving you to guess.</p></div>
'''),
